---
name: requirements-to-stories
description: Convert product requirements, meeting notes or feature requests into structured specs and Jira-ready user stories with acceptance criteria. Use whenever a user shares requirements or asks for stories, tickets, epics or acceptance criteria.
---

# Requirements to stories

1. Restate the requirement in one sentence and list any assumptions.
2. Split it into stories that each deliver user-visible value and fit in one sprint.
3. For each story write: title, "As a <role>, I want <capability>, so that <outcome>", and 3–6 acceptance criteria in Given/When/Then form.
4. Flag open questions instead of guessing.
5. Create drafts with `create_story_draft` and show them to the user for approval.
